  "npcs": [
    {
      "id": "lisette",
      "name": "Lisette",
      "model": "npc_worker",
      "x": 23,
      "z": 8,
      "facing": "s",
      "idle": "Idle",
      "outfit": "#e8a0b8",
      "hair": "#2b211c",
      "if": "!time:dusk & !time:night",
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "lines": [
            "Paper, wire, a drop of wax, and a wish folded inside. That's a lantern.",
            "I make them all day. At dusk I carry them down to the jetty and let them go, and they find each other on the water.",
            "By night they make a path straight across the mere. Walk it, if you like. They hold."
          ],
          "lines_fr": [
            "Du papier, du fil de fer, une goutte de cire, et un vœu plié dedans. C'est ça, une lanterne.",
            "J'en fais toute la journée. Au crépuscule, je les porte au ponton et je les lâche, et elles se retrouvent sur l'eau.",
            "La nuit, elles font un chemin tout droit à travers le lac. Marche dessus, si tu veux. Elles tiennent."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lisette_dusk",
      "name": "Lisette",
      "model": "npc_worker",
      "x": 23,
      "z": 13,
      "facing": "s",
      "idle": "Idle",
      "outfit": "#e8a0b8",
      "hair": "#2b211c",
      "if": "!time:day & !time:dawn",
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "lines": [
            "There they go. Watch: they drift, they turn, they line up. Every night, the same line, to the Moonwell.",
            "The Moonwell Garden is over there: Lumen's garden. Lumen's home again, and Nim tends the beds. The lanterns like them both."
          ],
          "lines_fr": [
            "Les voilà parties. Regarde : elles dérivent, elles tournent, elles s'alignent. Chaque nuit, la même ligne, jusqu'au Puits-de-Lune.",
            "Le Jardin du Puits-de-Lune est là-bas : le jardin de Lumen. Lumen est rentrée, et Nim soigne les massifs. Les lanternes les aiment bien toutes les deux."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "esme",
      "name": "Esme",
      "model": "npc_kid",
      "x": 15,
      "z": 11,
      "facing": "s",
      "idle": "Idle",
      "outfit": "#f2c6a0",
      "hair": "#e8d080",
      "if": "time:dawn",
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "lines": [
            "Shh. Everyone's asleep but me. Lanternmere goes to bed when the sun comes up.",
            "I like dawn. The lanterns go home, and the moonflowers close, and the whole lake is pink for a bit."
          ],
          "lines_fr": [
            "Chut. Tout le monde dort sauf moi. Lac-aux-Lanternes va se coucher quand le soleil se lève.",
            "J'aime l'aube. Les lanternes rentrent, les belles-de-lune se ferment, et tout le lac est rose un moment."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "barks": [
        {
          "if": "flag:sealed_lumen",
          "say": "Lumen's seal! The lanterns burn brighter.",
          "say_fr": "Le sceau de Lumen ! Les lanternes brillent plus fort."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ruben",
      "name": "Ruben",
      "model": "npc_scholar",
      "x": 30,
      "z": 8,
      "facing": "w",
      "idle": "Idle",
      "outfit": "#3a3f6a",
      "hair": "#c8c0b0",
      "if": "time:night",
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "lines": [
            "Three hundred and twelve. Three hundred and thirteen. Moths. Round every lamp in Lanternmere.",
            "I count them, I don't catch them. Well, I catch them, count them, let them go. The moth doesn't mind. Much.",
            "Hints, for a moth-counter's friend: the lanterns on the mere carry more than wishes. The moonflower beds in the Moonwell hide something only by night. And the islet: you'd need boots."
          ],
          "lines_fr": [
            "Trois cent douze. Trois cent treize. Des phalènes. Autour de chaque lampe de Lac-aux-Lanternes.",
            "Je les compte, je ne les attrape pas. Enfin, je les attrape, je les compte, je les relâche. La phalène ne s'en formalise pas. Trop.",
            "Des indices, pour un ami des compteurs de phalènes : les lanternes du lac portent plus que des vœux. Les massifs de belles-de-lune du Puits-de-Lune cachent quelque chose, la nuit seulement. Et l'îlot : il te faudrait des bottes."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "barks": [
        {
          "say": "Shh. The willows are dreaming.",
          "say_fr": "Chut. Les saules rêvent."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
